2149	## Intent
2150	
2151	**Problem:** Configurações shows no avatar/name/email (still the Story 2.4 toggle-only stub) and has no way to edit the display name (epic-8-context.md's Story 8.3 scope).
2152	
2153	**Approach:** Add a profile header (52dp avatar + name/email) above the biometric toggle. A pencil icon switches the name to an inline `AppTextField`; it becomes a check that saves via the existing `account-settings-update` PATCH and reverts to display mode. Tapping away unconfirmed reverts without saving.
2154	
2155	## Boundaries & Constraints
2156	
2157	**Always:**
2158	- `AccountSettingsDto` decodes `displayName`/`email` too (required strings), full-contract-decode precedent as `DashboardNarrativeDto`.
2159	- No new network call: `fetchBiometricEnabled()`'s success branch also sets new `_currentDisplayName`/`_currentEmail` (default `''`) from that response.
2160	- New `setDisplayName(String)`: own `_nameGeneration` guard (shape of `setBiometricEnabled`'s `_generation`, kept separate), **not optimistic** — await `AccountRemoteDataSource.updateDisplayName` (`{'displayName': name}`), set `_currentDisplayName` only on success.
2161	- Cubit reads `displayName`/`email` from the repository at construction. New state: `isEditingName`, `nameDraft`, `isSavingName`, `nameErrorMessage`. New methods: `startEditingName()` (draft = current name), `updateNameDraft()`, `cancelEditingName()` (no-op while saving), `confirmEditingName()` — trims draft; empty/unchanged reverts with no PATCH; otherwise saves, staying in edit mode with the error on failure (draft kept) or reverting with the new name on success.
2162	- Screen: header is the first scroll-`Column` child, above the toggle. `Avatar(size: AvatarSize.large)`, caller derives initials (first letter of first + last word). Name: `textTitleSm`+`colorTextPrimary`. Email: `dashboardNarrativeTextStyle`+`colorTextSecondary`. Icon: `Icons.edit`/`Icons.check`, `dialogIconSize`, `colorPrimary`, in `InkWell`+`ConstrainedBox(minHeight/minWidth: insertionModalTapTargetMin)` (tap-target fix, same as spec-8-2's retry link). Field + check icon in one `TapRegion(onTapOutside: cancelEditingName)`. Field: `AppTextField(controller, errorText: nameErrorMessage)`, no label/hint.
2163	- `_announce` fires on a save failure, same `BlocListener` convention as the toggle's error.
2164	- Keep `fetchBiometricEnabled()`'s name even though it now also sets `displayName`/`email` — renaming ripples into `main.dart`/`vault_lock_screen.dart` for no functional gain.
